#: proj4-extensions.md:1
msgid "Lennard Jones: Possible project extensions"
msgstr "Lennard-Jones：発展課題の提案"

#: proj4-extensions.md:3
msgid ""
"In the example project I studied how the heat capacity for a system of "
"Lennard Jones particles depends on temperature. The obvious extension for "
"you to try is to investigate the heat capacity as a function of temperature "
"for some other pair potential. You can do something as simple as changing "
"the powers of 6 and 12 in the Lennard Jones potential to different numbers. "
"Alternatively, if you want to try something more challenging you can try to "
"develop a completely different potential. For example, you could try to "
"investigate what happens if there are two minima in the potential energy as "
"a function of distance."
msgstr ""
"課題例では、Lennard-Jones Particles 系の Heat Capacity の温度依存性を調べた。他の Pair Potential "
"について同じことを調べるのが自然な発展である。Lennard-Jones Potential "
"の6と12の指数を別の値にするだけでもよい。さらに挑戦したい場合は、完全に異なる Potential を作ってもよい。例えば、距離の関数としての "
"Potential Energy に2つの Minima があると、何が起きるかを調べられる。"

#: proj4-extensions.md:9
msgid "The only limitations on the function that you choose are that:"
msgstr "選ぶ関数に必要な条件は、次のとおりである。"

#: proj4-extensions.md:11
msgid ""
"The pair potential $V(r)$ should be a continuous and differentiable function"
" of $r$."
msgstr "Pair Potential $V(r)$ が、$r$ の連続かつ微分可能な関数であること。"

#: proj4-extensions.md:12
msgid "The pair potential $V(r)$ should go to infinity as $r \\rightarrow 0$"
msgstr "$r \\rightarrow 0$ で、Pair Potential $V(r)$ が無限大へ向かうこと。"

# Corrected the source LaTeX command typo righarrow to rightarrow; the limit
# is unchanged.
#: proj4-extensions.md:13
msgid "The pair potential $V(r)$ should go to zero as $r \\righarrow \\infty$"
msgstr "$r \\rightarrow \\infty$ で、Pair Potential $V(r)$ が0へ向かうこと。"

# Closed the unpaired source math delimiter without changing V(r) or r.
#: proj4-extensions.md:15
msgid ""
"One way to generate an interesting potential would be to give the values for"
" $V(r) at a series of $r$ values and to then interpolate the function "
"between these points."
msgstr ""
"興味深い Potential を作る方法の1つは、複数の $r$ における $V(r)$ の値を指定し、その間を Interpolation "
"することである。"

#: proj4-extensions.md:18
msgid ""
"Please include a figure in any report you write on this topic that shows the"
" pair potential function that you have investigated."
msgstr "この課題のレポートには、調べた Pair Potential の関数を示す図を含めること。"
